// g-bootstrap-runaway-display-literal-cascades-before-closer: unterminated `"C:\"` body followed by a later `"`.
<program>
    type Ph:enum = { A, B }
    <ph:Ph=.A single>
        <A rule=.B>
            "C:\"
        </>
        <B rule=.A : "B">
    </>
    <main>
        <p><*ph/></p>
    </main>
</program>
